&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theslothsavant&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2192823&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608387373&quot; alt=&quot;TheSlothSavant&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2192823)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theslothsavant&quot;  &gt;TheSlothSavant&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-632787-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. The specifics of this mistake have been omitted in keeping with Protocol 5925-Eshu.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-632787-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. The specifics of SCP-5925&#039;s escape has been omitted in keeping with protocol 5925-Eshu.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-632787-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Described as akin to those of a stag.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-632787-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Later analysis of these stains suggest they are of tree sap, which may stem from repeated impacts against oak wood.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-632787-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. Commonly known as holly.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
