&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;The Personnel File&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello Hello!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I’m Kara!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No, no. Sit down, and shut up. Leaving is illegal, and there will be &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;appropriate&lt;/span&gt; lethal force taken to ensure you stay in this room.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So, about me…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I somehow managed to get an author page, so uh, yay!!! I have a &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/karas-art-page-of-doom&quot;&gt;cool art page&lt;/a&gt; I guess? Gonna try and break it soon! I write mostly tales here on this wiki. So, I guess if you want those you could scroll down. Maybe?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the meantime, I like &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/bird&quot;&gt;Team Bird&lt;/a&gt; WAY too much and I’ve read everything over like 5 almost 6 times now. Same with Parks and Recreation, but I’ve watched that show about 50 times over and have almost all of the script memorized. Did you know that I also hold a 2nd place speed run time for SCP-022?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aside from my bragging, we should get into things ACTUALLY about me. I’m 16, se/sim/serself, in marching band, jazz band, and concert band. I play bassoon, piano, and synth. We here in Texas love our football, but I just enjoy marching band. I have made region band 3 times, and honestly if you get me talking about band I may never shut up!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As you could probably tell I really like doing art. Did I mention my art page yet?!?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“Yeah, like 2 times now.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Well, fuck you too then!&lt;/p&gt;
