&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;Alison Chao, The Black Queen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/the-black-queen&quot;&gt;She has&lt;/a&gt; her own &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/black-queen-hub&quot;&gt;motivations.&lt;/a&gt; What they are have yet to be revealed.&lt;/p&gt;
